# Fold the maintainer's historical addresses into one identity, so `git shortlog`,
# `git log --use-mailmap` and the contributors graph report one person instead of
# three. The canonical address is the one used by the overwhelming majority of
# commits and by the repository's local user.email.
#
# GitHub's own <noreply@github.com> is deliberately absent: it is the committer
# identity GitHub uses when a commit is made through the web interface, and
# folding it into a person would misattribute that action.

Emiliano Pisu <pisuemiliano.1980@gmail.com> <emiliano.pisu@webidoo.com>
